        "answer": {
          "short": "Addition Rule.\n\n$$P(A\\cup B)=P(A)+P(B)-P(A\\cap B).$$",
          "worked": "Adding $P(A)$ and $P(B)$ counts the shared outcomes twice. Subtract the intersection probability once.\n\n$$P(A\\cup B)=P(A)+P(B)-P(A\\cap B)$$",
